{"seq":1,"slug":"transactional-outbox-pattern","title":"事务性发件箱：本地消息表与原子落库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transaction-consistency-patterns/outbox-reliable-messaging/transactional-outbox-pattern","wordCount":2728,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"事务性发件箱-本地消息表与原子落库\">事务性发件箱：本地消息表与原子落库</h1><p>一笔支付在本地事务里改完余额、提交成功后，进程在发送「支付成功」消息前被 OOM Killer 干掉——数据库里钱已经扣了，下游履约永远等不到这条消息。这不是消息中间件的可靠性问题，中间件从头到尾没收到任何东西；这是<strong>本地状态变更与远程消息发布之间缺了一个原子边界</strong>。事务性发件箱（Transactional Outbox）的全部价值，就是把这个边界补回去。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>事务性发件箱的定义是「<strong>在业务数据的同一个本地事务中，把要发送的消息写入一张数据库表（发件箱）</strong>」，再由独立的中继（relay）把这张表里的行投递到消息中间件（<a href=\"https://microservices.io/patterns/data/transactional-outbox.html\">microservices.io: Transactional Outbox</a>）。它把消息发布从「一次远程调用」降级为「一次本地写入」，让两个动作共享同一个原子边界，可靠性由中继重试保证而非由业务代码的调用顺序保证。它成立需要三个前提：<strong>业务写入与发件箱写入在同一数据库</strong>、<strong>投递是至少一次</strong>（消费者必须幂等）、<strong>消息体在写入时刻即完整序列化</strong>（存事件快照而非「稍后回查」的意图）。与 2PC、TCC、Saga 的分工也由此清晰：它们解决跨服务如何达成整体一致，发件箱只解决<strong>一次本地写入如何可靠对外发出一个事件</strong>——它是所有分布式事务模式底下的投递基座，而非替代品。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双写问题-为什么-写库再发消息-必然漏\">双写问题：为什么「写库再发消息」必然漏</h2><p>这个缺陷叫<strong>双写不一致（dual-write problem）</strong>：一个业务操作写入两个彼此独立、无法共享事务的系统。Chris Richardson 在 microservices.io 上把发件箱定位为对它的直接回应——「用一个数据库事务原子地更新数据库并发送消息」（<a href=\"https://microservices.io/patterns/data/transactional-outbox.html\">microservices.io: Transactional Outbox</a>）。两种朴素写法的失败点说明了为什么重试修补不了：<strong>先写库后发消息</strong>，两次操作之间任意一个崩溃窗口（进程崩溃、网络中断、Broker 拒绝），都会留下「库改了、消息没发」的永久缺口，重试无法补救，因为消息从未存在过；<strong>先发消息后写库</strong>，反过来留下「消息发了、库没改」，下游照着一条从未发生的业务事实行动。两者的共同本质是 <code>COMMIT</code> 与 <code>PUBLISH</code> 属于两个不同的原子域，任何把它们排成先后顺序的方案都在两个域之间开了一道可观测的裂缝。发件箱不是去堵这道裂缝，而是让它消失——<strong>把「要发的消息」也当作一行业务数据，写进同一次本地事务</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[业务操作] --&gt; B[BEGIN 本地事务]&#10;  B --&gt; C[写业务表&lt;br/&gt;UPDATE accounts]&#10;  C --&gt; D[写发件箱表&lt;br/&gt;INSERT INTO outbox]&#10;  D --&gt; E[COMMIT&lt;br/&gt;两个写原子生效]&#10;  E --&gt; F{投递链路}&#10;  F --&gt;|路径一| G[轮询发布器]&#10;  F --&gt;|路径二| H[事务日志挖掘&lt;br/&gt;WAL / binlog]&#10;  G --&gt; I[Broker]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[消费者&lt;br/&gt;幂等去重]&#10;  J --&gt; K[标记 sent / 归档]\">graph TD\n  A[业务操作] --&gt; B[BEGIN 本地事务]\n  B --&gt; C[写业务表&lt;br/&gt;UPDATE accounts]\n  C --&gt; D[写发件箱表&lt;br/&gt;INSERT INTO outbox]\n  D --&gt; E[COMMIT&lt;br/&gt;两个写原子生效]\n  E --&gt; F{投递链路}\n  F --&gt;|路径一| G[轮询发布器]\n  F --&gt;|路径二| H[事务日志挖掘&lt;br/&gt;WAL / binlog]\n  G --&gt; I[Broker]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[消费者&lt;br/&gt;幂等去重]\n  J --&gt; K[标记 sent / 归档]</pre><p>图中最关键的一条边是 <code>COMMIT</code> 之后的分叉：<strong>投递机制可以选，但「消息已持久化」这个事实从 COMMIT 那一刻起不可撤销</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本地消息表-把消息写进业务事务\">本地消息表：把消息写进业务事务</h2><p>发件箱表的本质是一张普通关系表，字段通常包括：全局唯一 <code>id</code>（消息去重键）、<code>aggregate_type</code> / <code>aggregate_id</code>（标明这条消息改了哪个聚合，也是 Kafka 分区键的天然来源）、<code>event_type</code>、<code>payload</code>（序列化后的事件体，常见 JSON）、<code>created_at</code>。业务代码的正确形态是「一条 SQL 事务里两次写」，顺序无关紧要，重要的是它们落在同一个事务边界内：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"BEGIN;&#10;UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance - 100 WHERE id = :from;&#10;INSERT INTO outbox (id, aggregate_type, aggregate_id, event_type, payload, created_at)&#10;VALUES (:msg_id, &#39;Account&#39;, :from, &#39;FundsDebited&#39;, :json, now());&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outbox (id, aggregate_type, aggregate_id, event_type, payload, created_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (:msg_id, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Account'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FundsDebited'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个容易踩的坑：<strong>用自增列做主键</strong>会让分区与并发排序不可控，建议用 UUID/ULID 并在业务侧生成，使消息 id 在写库前就已知（消费者去重与链路追踪都要它）；<strong>不要先做业务校验再条件插入</strong>——发件箱行必须与业务变更同生共死，业务变更回滚则发件箱行一起回滚，这正是本地事务免费提供的语义。发件箱要求消费者容忍<strong>同一事件被投递多次</strong>，这不是缺陷而是设计选择：让「不漏」优先于「不重」，把去重下沉到消费者，是可用性与复杂度之间更划算的交换——与 <a href=\"../saga-long-transactions/saga-orchestration-vs-choreography\">Saga 拓扑：编排式与协同式长事务</a> 里「用可见中间态换可用性」同源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两条投递链路-轮询发布器与事务日志挖掘\">两条投递链路：轮询发布器与事务日志挖掘</h2><p>从发件箱表到 Broker 有两条主流路径。<strong>路径一：轮询发布器（Polling Publisher）</strong>：后台进程定期 <code>SELECT</code> 未发送的行、发布、再标记为已发送，官方模式页把它描述为「通过轮询数据库中的发件箱表来发布消息」（<a href=\"https://microservices.io/patterns/data/polling-publisher.html\">microservices.io: Polling Publisher</a>）。它<strong>不依赖数据库的特定能力</strong>，普通 SQL 即可。多实例并发的正确姿势是：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT * FROM outbox&#10;WHERE status = &#39;PENDING&#39;&#10;ORDER BY created_at&#10;FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED&#10;LIMIT 100;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outbox</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PENDING'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SKIP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LOCKED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED</code> 让多个发布器实例各取一批互不冲突的行，无需外部锁。代价是轮询间隔带来延迟下限，高频轮询在高写负载库上造成额外压力，标记/删除也占用写带宽。</p>\n<p><strong>路径二：事务日志挖掘（Transaction Log Tailing / CDC）</strong>。把发件箱表接上变更数据捕获，直接读数据库的预写日志（WAL / binlog），把每次 <code>INSERT INTO outbox</code> 变成一条流式事件，无需应用侧轮询。Debezium 的 Outbox Event Router 单消息转换（SMT，<code>io.debezium.transforms.outbox.EventRouter</code>）就是为此设计的：它按约定列名解析发件箱行，把 <code>payload</code> 提升为事件体，并把 <code>aggregate_id</code> 用作 Kafka 记录的 key，从而保住分区内有序性（<a href=\"https://debezium.io/documentation/reference/stable/transformations/outbox-event-router.html\">Debezium: Outbox Event Router</a>）。PostgreSQL 侧的能力来自逻辑解码（logical decoding），它把 WAL 中已提交事务的变更以可消费形式解出（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/logicaldecoding-explanation.html\">PostgreSQL: Logical Decoding</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>轮询发布器</th>\n<th>事务日志挖掘（CDC）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>受轮询间隔约束（秒级常见）</td>\n<td>近实时（亚秒至百毫秒级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库依赖</td>\n<td>仅需普通 SQL</td>\n<td>需逻辑复制/binlog 能力与复制槽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用耦合</td>\n<td>发布器属于应用</td>\n<td>应用只写表，投递完全外置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主库压力</td>\n<td>轮询与标记写产生额外负载</td>\n<td>读 WAL，压力主要在复制槽保留期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顺序保证</td>\n<td>需自行按 aggregate 排序</td>\n<td>按 key 分区天然有序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>需管理连接器、复制槽与位点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判据可压缩成一句：<strong>已有 CDC 基础设施且数据库支持逻辑复制就用日志挖掘，否则先用轮询发布器把正确性拿到手，再按延迟需求演进</strong>。从轮询切到 CDC 时行归属与位点语义都会变，切换期间必须确保<strong>不重不漏</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"至少一次语义下的幂等与去重\">至少一次语义下的幂等与去重</h2><p>投递链路保证「至少一次」，因此消费者<strong>必然</strong>会遇到重复消息。设单次投递失败概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，独立重试 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次后仍未被投递的概率约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>丢失</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{丢失}) \\approx p^{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">丢失</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，增大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 就能把丢失概率压到任意低，这正是「用重试换不漏」的量化表达。但重试总引入重复，于是幂等成为发件箱的<strong>强制配套</strong>：<strong>消费端去重表</strong>以消息 <code>id</code> 为主键建处理记录表，处理业务与写入去重记录必须在同一事务里，用唯一约束冲突丢弃重复；<strong>业务天然幂等</strong>把操作改写成幂等形式（<code>SET balance = 500</code> 而非 <code>balance = balance - 100</code>）；下游是 Kafka 时，开启生产者幂等（<code>enable.idempotence=true</code>）可消除生产者重试造成的重复写入，事务 API 还能把「消费-处理-生产」串成一次原子提交（<a href=\"https://kafka.apache.org/documentation/#producerconfigs_enable.idempotence\">Apache Kafka: Producer Configs</a>），但它只覆盖<strong>生产者到 Broker</strong> 这一段，消除不了「消费者读到了两次」这类上游重复。</p>\n<p>去重记录不能无限增长，保留窗口至少要覆盖<strong>消息在链路中的最大存活时间 + 消费者最大回退时间</strong>：设保留期为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{retain}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、最大重试退避为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{retry}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、时钟偏移为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{dedup} \\ge T_{retain} + T_{retry} + \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"表设计与生命周期-分区-清理与回压\">表设计与生命周期：分区、清理与回压</h2><p>发件箱表是<strong>只增不减的高写入队列</strong>，会以业务写的同速增长，没人清理几周内就会成为库里最大的表并拖慢每次提交。因此：按 <code>created_at</code> 做范围分区，清理用 <code>DROP PARTITION</code> 而非逐行 <code>DELETE</code>（后者产生死元组与膨胀，长事务下还可能拖垮 vacuum）；已发送行的处理两条路径不同——CDC 的位点由复制槽管理，行发布后即可删或归档，轮询则要保留到「确认已发送」之后再清，两者都须保证<strong>清理不早于确认</strong>否则漏发。核心监控指标是<strong>未发送行数与最老未发送行的时间差</strong>（lag），它比 Broker 堆积更能反映端到端健康度，因为覆盖了「写库成功但投递停滞」这类故障。CDC 路径还要警惕：消费者长期离线会让复制槽<strong>无限保留 WAL</strong>，撑爆磁盘。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失败模式与工程检查清单\">失败模式与工程检查清单</h2><p>发件箱补上了双写的裂缝，却只是把不可控的漏发转成可控可观测的延迟投递。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败模式</th>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>应对</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发布器反复崩溃</td>\n<td>行长期 <code>PENDING</code>，lag 上升</td>\n<td>发布器无状态可重启，配 lag 告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复投递</td>\n<td>消费者处理同一事件两次</td>\n<td>消费端幂等去重，不依赖链路去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发件箱膨胀</td>\n<td>提交变慢、磁盘告警</td>\n<td>时间分区 + <code>DROP PARTITION</code>，监控表大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复制槽撑爆 WAL</td>\n<td>数据库磁盘写满</td>\n<td>独立监控复制槽位点与磁盘水位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顺序错乱</td>\n<td>同一聚合事件被乱序消费</td>\n<td>以 <code>aggregate_id</code> 为分区键，保 key 内有序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>schema 漂移</td>\n<td>消费者无法反序列化旧事件</td>\n<td>版本化 payload，消费者向后兼容</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行值得展开：发件箱里的历史行会在改动后一段时间内持续被投递，<strong>消费者必须同时处理新旧两种 schema</strong>，故 payload 变更要按「先兼容读、再切换写、最后清旧」三步走。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>发件箱消灭的是裂缝本身</strong>：把消息当作一行业务数据写进同一次本地事务，<code>COMMIT</code> 与 <code>PUBLISH</code> 不再是两个原子域。</li>\n<li><strong>投递链路二选一</strong>：轮询发布器（普通 SQL、秒级延迟、<code>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED</code> 并发）与事务日志挖掘（CDC / 逻辑解码、近实时、投递外置）。</li>\n<li><strong>至少一次是设计选择而非缺陷</strong>：重试把丢失概率从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，代价是重复，消费端幂等去重是强制配套。</li>\n<li><strong>发件箱表是队列不是业务表</strong>：按时间分区、及时清理、监控未发送行 lag 与复制槽位点。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>发件箱解决的是「一次本地写如何可靠对外发一个事件」，多个服务间的整体一致仍要交给 <a href=\"../saga-long-transactions/saga-orchestration-vs-choreography\">Saga 拓扑：编排式与协同式长事务</a> 与 <a href=\"../commit-protocols-2pc-tcc/two-phase-commit-internals\">2PC 内部机制</a>；「至少一次 + 幂等消费」背后的可用性换原子性取向，根子在 <a href=\"../consistency-models-and-problem/consistency-spectrum-and-base\">一致性谱系与 BASE</a> 与 <a href=\"../consistency-models-and-problem/distributed-failure-model\">分布式事务的故障模型</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"事务性发件箱：本地消息表与原子落库","id":"事务性发件箱-本地消息表与原子落库"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"双写问题：为什么「写库再发消息」必然漏","id":"双写问题-为什么-写库再发消息-必然漏"},{"level":2,"text":"本地消息表：把消息写进业务事务","id":"本地消息表-把消息写进业务事务"},{"level":2,"text":"两条投递链路：轮询发布器与事务日志挖掘","id":"两条投递链路-轮询发布器与事务日志挖掘"},{"level":2,"text":"至少一次语义下的幂等与去重","id":"至少一次语义下的幂等与去重"},{"level":2,"text":"表设计与生命周期：分区、清理与回压","id":"表设计与生命周期-分区-清理与回压"},{"level":2,"text":"失败模式与工程检查清单","id":"失败模式与工程检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Saga 状态机持久化与崩溃恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transaction-consistency-patterns/saga-long-transactions/saga-state-machine-recovery"},"next":{"title":"CDC 中继投递与幂等消费去重","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transaction-consistency-patterns/outbox-reliable-messaging/cdc-relay-and-idempotent-consume"}}